{"id":"ru_ckseite","lemma":"Rückseite","pos":"noun","rank":4654,"glosses":["back, reverse side"],"ipa":"/ˈʁʏkˌsaɪ̯tə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/63/De-R%C3%BCckseite.ogg/De-R%C3%BCckseite.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Rückseite","plural":"Rückseiten"},"examples":[{"text":"Er ging zur Rückseite des Gebäudes.","en":"He went to the back of the building.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"of the","l":"der"},{"g":"building","l":"Gebäude"}]},{"text":"Unterschreiben Sie diesen Scheck auf der Rückseite.","en":"Endorse this check.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/391562","words":[{"g":"to sign"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"check, cheque"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Unterschreibe diesen Scheck auf der Rückseite!","en":"Endorse this check.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/391561","words":[{"g":"to sign","l":"unterschreiben"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"check, cheque"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe seine Adresse auf die Rückseite des Briefumschlags geschrieben.","en":"I've written his address on the back of the envelope.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},{"g":"address"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"of the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"to write, to write out","l":"schreiben"}]},{"text":"Ich kritzelte seine Adresse auf die Rückseite meines Tagebuchs.","en":"I scribbled down his address in the back of my diary.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},{"g":"address"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"mine","l":"meiner"},null]}]}